25:  * Crucially it drives the *same* behaviour as the real avatar will —
26:  * head/neck/spine split, eye tracking with saccades, irregular blinking,
27:  * amplitude-driven mouth. So the gate, the audio pipeline and the tracking are
28:  * all exercised for real now, and swapping in the Ready Player Me GLB is a
29:  * change of geometry, not of logic.
30:  */
