67: /**
68:  * Micro-saccades — the highest value-per-line detail in the whole avatar.
69:  *
70:  * Human eyes never track smoothly across a static scene; they jump. An eye that
71:  * follows a cursor perfectly smoothly is the single clearest uncanny tell, and
72:  * about fifteen lines of jitter removes it.
73:  */
